<Robo>
  <Heading level="1" align="center">Robo Position Engine</Heading>
  <Paragraph align="center">
    Native C++ 2D coordinate positioning engine with live WebAssembly rasterization, absolute/relative/fixed modes, z-index layering, corner anchors, floating overlays, and interactive hit testing.
  </Paragraph>

  <H2>1. Absolute Canvas with Overlapping Cards (zIndex Layering)</H2>
  <Paragraph>Elements placed at explicit pixel coordinates with zIndex determining paint and click stacking order:</Paragraph>
  <Position width="100%" minHeight="270" background="#FFFFFF" cornerRadius="16" borderColor="#E5E5EA" borderWidth="1" padding="16">
    <!-- Base Layer (zIndex=1) -->
    <Flexbox left="20" top="20" width="340" zIndex="1" direction="column" gap="8" padding="16" background="#F2F2F7" cornerRadius="12">
      <H4 color="#8E8E93">Background Card (zIndex="1")</H4>
      <Paragraph fontSize="13" color="#636366">Base content plane placed at left="20" top="20".</Paragraph>
      <Button variant="plain">Secondary Link</Button>
    </Flexbox>

    <!-- Foreground Overlapping Layer (zIndex=10) -->
    <Flexbox left="200" top="50" width="360" zIndex="10" direction="column" gap="8" padding="16" background="#1C1C1E" cornerRadius="12">
      <H4 color="#FFFFFF">Elevated Modal Card (zIndex="10")</H4>
      <Paragraph fontSize="13" color="#AEAEB2">Overlaps the background card. Inputs and buttons here receive pointer events first.</Paragraph>
      <Button variant="filled" background="#007AFF">Elevated Action</Button>
    </Flexbox>

    <!-- Floating Badge on Top (zIndex=20) -->
    <Button left="500" top="30" zIndex="20" variant="filled" background="#FF3B30" color="#FFFFFF">LIVE BADGE (zIndex="20")</Button>
  </Position>

  <H2>2. Corner Anchoring &amp; Badging</H2>
  <Paragraph>Pinning elements to container corners using explicit anchors (TopLeft, TopRight, BottomRight, Center):</Paragraph>
  <Position width="100%" height="200" background="#F2F2F7" cornerRadius="16" padding="16">
    <Button anchor="topLeft" left="16" top="16" variant="filled">Top-Left Pin</Button>
    <Button anchor="topRight" right="16" top="16" variant="filled" background="#34C759">Top-Right Pin</Button>
    <Button anchor="center" variant="filled" background="#5856D6">Centered Control</Button>
    <Button anchor="bottomLeft" left="16" bottom="16" variant="gray">Bottom-Left Pin</Button>
    <Button anchor="bottomRight" right="16" bottom="16" variant="tinted">Bottom-Right Pin</Button>
  </Position>

  <H2>3. Floating Action Button (FAB) &amp; Overlay on Dashboard Card</H2>
  <Paragraph>A content dashboard card with a floating overlay pill and a bottom-right action button:</Paragraph>
  <Position width="100%" minHeight="210" background="#FFFFFF" cornerRadius="16" borderColor="#E5E5EA" borderWidth="1" padding="20">
    <!-- Main content flow inside positioned frame -->
    <Flexbox left="20" top="20" width="520" direction="column" gap="10">
      <H3>Compute Engine Cluster #04</H3>
      <Paragraph fontSize="14" color="#636366">
        8 Nodes Active • 99.98% Uptime • Silicon M-Series Architecture • Region: US-East
      </Paragraph>
      <Input variant="bordered" placeholder="Execute quick cluster command...">robo cluster scale --nodes=12</Input>
    </Flexbox>

    <!-- Floating Top-Right Notification Chip (zIndex=5) -->
    <Button right="20" top="20" zIndex="5" variant="tinted" color="#30D158">Healthy (99.9%)</Button>

    <!-- Floating Action Button (FAB) at Bottom-Right (zIndex=15) -->
    <Button right="20" bottom="20" zIndex="15" variant="filled" background="#007AFF" color="#FFFFFF">+ Add Node</Button>
  </Position>

  <H2>4. Relative Positioning Offsets</H2>
  <Paragraph>Nudging controls relative to their baseline placement using mode="relative":</Paragraph>
  <Flexbox direction="row" align="center" gap="16" padding="16" background="#FFFFFF" cornerRadius="14" borderColor="#E5E5EA" borderWidth="1">
    <Button variant="gray">Standard Button</Button>
    <Position mode="relative" top="-8" left="6">
      <Button variant="filled" background="#FF9500">Nudged Button (top="-8")</Button>
    </Position>
    <Position mode="relative" top="10">
      <Button variant="tinted">Offset Down (top="10")</Button>
    </Position>
  </Flexbox>

  <H2>5. Position Composed Inside a Grid</H2>
  <Paragraph>Position containers functioning as cells within a 2-column grid layout:</Paragraph>
  <Grid columns="1fr 1fr" gap="16">
    <Position height="150" background="#1C1C1E" cornerRadius="14" padding="16">
      <H4 color="#FFFFFF" left="16" top="16">Telemetry Node A</H4>
      <Paragraph color="#8E8E93" left="16" top="48" fontSize="13">Real-time memory pressure: 34%</Paragraph>
      <Button left="16" bottom="16" variant="tinted">View Telemetry</Button>
      <Button right="16" bottom="16" variant="filled" background="#30D158">Active</Button>
    </Position>

    <Position height="150" background="#FFFFFF" cornerRadius="14" borderColor="#E5E5EA" borderWidth="1" padding="16">
      <H4 left="16" top="16">Security Scanner</H4>
      <Paragraph color="#636366" left="16" top="48" fontSize="13">0 vulnerabilities found • Last run 2m ago</Paragraph>
      <Input left="16" bottom="16" width="220" variant="bordered" placeholder="Scan filter...">auth-*</Input>
      <Button right="16" bottom="16" variant="filled">Run</Button>
    </Position>
  </Grid>
</Robo>
